# =============================================================================
# Pushsidian Obsidian Plugin — Settings (not env vars)
# =============================================================================
# These are entered in the plugin settings tab inside Obsidian.
#
# Get your API key from the web app → Profile → API Keys
# =============================================================================

# Example settings:
#   API Key:       psk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#   API Base URL:  http://localhost:3000  (dev) or https://api.pushsidian.com (prod)
#   Organization:  org_xxxxxxxxxxxx
